{
    "word": "humph",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "5082fa0e-6ac6-37f5-8fc2-eb7fb12bf564",
                "word": "humph",
                "pos": "intj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "62250b3b-fd8b-3923-a7ee-3ad21e4c9fcd",
                        "entry_id": "5082fa0e-6ac6-37f5-8fc2-eb7fb12bf564",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A sound, usually made with a closed mouth pouting, indicating annoyance, indignation, disapproval, doubt, or sighing."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "onomatopoeic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff3277de-473e-4eeb-bbaf-f67ca9157339",
                                "sense_id": "62250b3b-fd8b-3923-a7ee-3ad21e4c9fcd",
                                "text": "`Beauty is too rare upon it. Give me no thanks, who am made happy by thy coming.' `Humph! old fellow,' said Leo aside to me in English, `the lady is very civil.'"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5e9f5f50-b63e-4d7c-b544-4ea9b105f9b5",
                                "sense_id": "62250b3b-fd8b-3923-a7ee-3ad21e4c9fcd",
                                "text": "\"There!\" panted Pollyanna, hastily plucking a pink from a vase near by and tucking it into the dark hair where it would give the best effect. \"Now I reckon we're ready to be looked at!\" And she held out the mirror in triumph.\n\"Humph!\" grunted the sick woman, eyeing her reflection severely. \"I like red pinks better than pink ones; but then, it'll fade, anyhow, before night, so what's the difference!\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "54766d80-d7e7-422a-87d3-d7a72eedeb86",
                        "source_entry_id": "5082fa0e-6ac6-37f5-8fc2-eb7fb12bf564",
                        "source_sense_id": "62250b3b-fd8b-3923-a7ee-3ad21e4c9fcd",
                        "source_sense_description": "used to express doubt or disapproval",
                        "target_lang_word": "hum",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hum",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0a489d22-7831-3600-9503-64ae40070d29",
                                        "entry_id": "587c4181-c872-3b56-8424-7ad6d711e153",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Interjection qui marque doute, réticence, impatience."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "906ec5d8-8707-4cee-86cd-efcc1ca94686",
                                                "sense_id": "0a489d22-7831-3600-9503-64ae40070d29",
                                                "text": "La comtesse : Allez porter ma lettre. — Lisette à part : Hum ! il y a ici quelque chose."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04b7d0b4-8eb4-4242-90e5-93647919a5cf",
                                                "sense_id": "0a489d22-7831-3600-9503-64ae40070d29",
                                                "text": "Cet argument sans réplique produisit une espèce de hum ! d’acquiescement de la part du Saxon […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf66f855-85c4-4fc7-ba85-140b2bed14cf",
                                                "sense_id": "0a489d22-7831-3600-9503-64ae40070d29",
                                                "text": "Hum ! Hum ! fit Corcoran d’un air pensif."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca249cc5-a84d-4e4e-aa03-d9b180844e26",
                                                "sense_id": "0a489d22-7831-3600-9503-64ae40070d29",
                                                "text": "Je me délectais, aux repas, de récits à mots couverts, de ce langage, employé par les parents, où le vocable hermétique remplace le terme vulgaire, où la moue significative et le « hum » théâtral appellent et soutiennent l’attention des enfants."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8017d982-eaa6-4331-8696-5d881289f574",
                                                "sense_id": "0a489d22-7831-3600-9503-64ae40070d29",
                                                "text": "J’allais enfin retomber au sommeil quand, à travers l’ombre, arrivait, du fond de l’appartement, un léger « hum ! hum ! »."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "27c115a9-18ac-30a2-8ed9-e4af3722410b",
                                        "entry_id": "587c4181-c872-3b56-8424-7ad6d711e153",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Marque d’un certain plaisir à ressentir quelque chose, odeurs, sensations, etc. Notes : dans ce cas se prononce généralement différemment ^((h aspiré))\\\\œ:m\\\\."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "446a04bb-fe32-40a4-b392-adb7bcc709bd",
                                                "sense_id": "27c115a9-18ac-30a2-8ed9-e4af3722410b",
                                                "text": "Un nez froid s'est posé sur ma bouche et j'ai entendu une voix qui disait : Hum ! Ça sent bon la banane fraîche !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "abfd81d2-d032-4bb3-afee-5eceab28cbcb",
                                                "sense_id": "27c115a9-18ac-30a2-8ed9-e4af3722410b",
                                                "text": "Hum, j'adore ma moto, mais ce jour-là, je l'ai vénérée."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cfaa55e2-3b27-45d1-927e-ea1f44fd2295",
                                                "sense_id": "27c115a9-18ac-30a2-8ed9-e4af3722410b",
                                                "text": "Hum ... , approuva Caitlyn en regardant le splendide mâle debout devant elle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba368588-debe-4322-9259-09027cb76405",
                                                "sense_id": "27c115a9-18ac-30a2-8ed9-e4af3722410b",
                                                "text": "Hum ! Trop bon. Mais après l'avoir dégusté, je me suis levé avec un peu de regret."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
